@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Toggletip}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Accessibility}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Toggletip @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Accessibility</PageTitle>

<h1>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Toggletip @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Accessibility</h1>
<p>
    The Toggletip component was built using the HTML Popover API and follows all best practices for non-modal dialogs.
</p>

<h2 id="toggle-tip-keyboard">Keyboard interaction</h2>
<ul aria-labelledby="toggle-tip-keyboard">
    <li><kbd class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Neutral)">Space</kbd> - when focus is on the toggletip icon, expands/collapses the toggletip popover.</li>
    <li><kbd class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Neutral)">Enter</kbd> - when focus is on the toggletip icon, expands/collapses the toggletip popover.</li>
    <li><kbd class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Neutral)">Escape</kbd> - closes the toggletip.</li>
    <li><kbd class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Neutral)">Tab</kbd> - moves focus to the next focusable item in the tab sequence.</li>
    <li><kbd class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Neutral)">Tab</kbd> <b>+</b> <kbd class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Neutral)">Shift</kbd> - moves focus to the previous focusable item in the tab sequence.</li>
</ul>


<p>
    The Toggletip remains open when focus is moved to an element outside of it.
    <strong>Note:</strong> Clicking outside of the Toggletip will close it.
</p>

<h2 id="device-testing">Accessibility device testing</h2>

<ul aria-labelledby="device-testing">
    <li>JAWS, Narrator and NVDA on Windows were each paired with every one of the following browsers: Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge and Mozilla Firefox.</li>
    <li>VoiceOver on macOS was paired with Apple's Safari.</li>
    <li>VoiceOver on iPhone was paired with mobile Safari.</li>
    <li>Talkback on Android was paired with mobile Google Chrome.</li>
    <li>Voice access on Windows 11</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>Note: </strong> Testing was performed with the latest browser and assistive technologies versions that were available at the time of testing (see release history on the installation page for approximate testing dates)
</p>

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Toggletip}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Installation}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Toggletip - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Installation</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Toggletip}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Api}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Toggletip - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Api</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
